ngs \\[sys\\_transform\\_entry\\] from the source fields of an import set to the fields of the target table.Define transform scripts \\[sys\\_transform\\_script\\] that run at different stages of the import process.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/application-development/servicenow-sdk/fluent-import-sets-api.html","release":"australia","product":"ServiceNow SDK","classification":"servicenow-sdk","topic_type":"reference","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":12,"keywords":["servicenow fluent","fluent api","servicenow fluent","fluent api","servicenow fluent","fluent api","servicenow fluent","fluent api"],"breadcrumb":["ServiceNow Fluent API reference","Reference","ServiceNow SDK","Building applications in source code","Building pro-code applications","Developing your application","Building applications"],"tags":["#application-development","#sdk","#local-dev","#developer-tools","#typescript","#type-reference"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[243,248],[336,496]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/application-development/servicenow-sdk/fluent-import-sets-api.md"},
